* ideal_core.lib — behavioral threshold core for L3 SIL (GATE-L3-SIL)
* Abstraction: threshold-law Ic flip + fixed sense pulse — NOT Chan / coremem.
* REQ-SCALE-ANTIX: L3 is the only full-matrix sim path; no Chan at n=64.
*
* Ports: xp/xn X winding, yp/yn Y, sp/sn sense.
* State node `state`: +1 stored-1, −1 stored-0.
* Ith ≈ Ic = 0.6 A (sim assumption Ic=600 mA; Ic/2=300 mA half-select).
* Sense: fixed pulse amplitude on destructive READ (1→0 under negative MMF).

.subckt ideal_core xp xn yp yn sp sn
.param Ith=0.6 Phis=1e-7 tau=50n Vsense=1.0

Vx xp x1 0
Ex x1 xn value={Phis*ddt(V(state))}
Vy yp y1 0
Ey y1 yn value={Phis*ddt(V(state))}
Vs sp s1 0
Es s1 sn value={Phis*ddt(V(state))+V(pulse)}

Bmmf mmf 0 V=I(Vx)+I(Vy)+I(Vs)
Cstate state 0 1n IC=-1
* Soft step toward sign(MMF) when |MMF|≥Ith; hold otherwise
Gstate 0 state value={u(abs(V(mmf))-{Ith}+1m)*(tanh(40*(V(mmf)/{Ith}))-V(state))/{tau}}
Rleak state 0 1G

* Fixed sense pulse proxy (edge of destructive flip)
Bpulse pulse 0 V={Vsense * u(-V(mmf)-{Ith}+1m) * u(V(state)+0.5)}

.ends ideal_core
